### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:8127/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 1200.0,
  "locale": "vi"
}

### Get the product - Should miss cache and query DB first time
GET http://localhost:8127/api/products/1?locale=vi

### Get the product again - Should hit cache (check application logs to verify DB is not queried)
GET http://localhost:8127/api/products/1?locale=vi

### Update the product - Should update DB and cache (CachePut)
PUT http://localhost:8127/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1300.0
}

### Get the product again - Should return updated price directly from cache
GET http://localhost:8127/api/products/1?locale=vi

### Evict specific product from cache (CacheEvict)
DELETE http://localhost:8127/api/products/1/cache

### Get the product - Should miss cache after eviction and query DB
GET http://localhost:8127/api/products/1?locale=vi

### Evict all products from cache
DELETE http://localhost:8127/api/products/cache/all
